  "question": {
    "text": "A single slit of a width $a$ is illuminated by a monochromatic light of wavelength $600 \\mathrm{~nm}$. The value of ' $a$ ' for which first minimum appears at $\\theta$ $=30^{\\circ}$ on the screen will be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
