  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Wavelength of monochromatic light,<br />$\\lambda=600 \\times 10^{-9} \\mathrm{~m}$<br />As fir first minima a $\\sin \\theta=\\lambda$<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a} \\sin 30^{\\circ}=600 \\times 10^{-9} \\\\<br />& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a}=1200 \\times 10^{-9} \\mathrm{~m}=1.2 \\mu \\mathrm{m}<br />\\end{aligned}$",
